Miss Carrington!

01:13:05.900 --> 01:13:08.040
Well, where is she?

01:13:08.080 --> 01:13:09.500
She was here a second ago.

01:13:09.740 --> 01:13:10.940
Well, what's happened now?

01:13:11.000 --> 01:13:12.080
Miss Carrington disappeared.

01:13:12.670 --> 01:13:13.650
Well, I left her with him.

01:13:13.970 --> 01:13:15.970
Say, what is this, the fun house at the beach?

01:13:16.540 --> 01:13:18.080
Everybody that talks to you disappears.

01:13:18.720 --> 01:13:19.970
Now I'm talking to you.

01:13:20.450 --> 01:13:22.030
I suppose I'll turn up missing.

01:13:22.330 --> 01:13:24.470
That is the best suggestion you've made tonight.

01:13:24.610 --> 01:13:25.570
Well, that's all right.

01:13:26.750 --> 01:13:28.850
Don't you ever park near a fireplug.

01:13:29.210 --> 01:13:30.000
That's for you.

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:33.120
- Officer, I want to go home.

01:13:33.120 --> 01:13:37.610
- I'll tell you when to go, and I'll tell you where to go.

01:13:37.610 --> 01:13:50.790
Sit down.

01:13:50.790 --> 01:13:52.170
- Disappeared.

01:13:52.170 --> 01:13:53.010
- Disappeared?

01:13:53.010 --> 01:13:53.990
- Entirely.

01:13:53.990 --> 01:13:55.090
- Well, we've got to find her.

01:13:55.090 --> 01:13:57.340
- Police won't let me out of their sight.

01:13:57.340 --> 01:13:58.610
- Well, they can't stop me.

01:14:01.440 --> 01:14:04.420
- Don't go out there, Mrs. Topper's just outside.

01:14:04.420 --> 01:14:05.960
- I'll fix that.

01:14:05.960 --> 01:14:18.610
- Where is who, dear?

01:14:18.610 --> 01:14:21.780
- You know that I mean, that girl.

01:14:21.780 --> 01:14:22.740
- But there wasn't any.

01:14:22.740 --> 01:14:23.740
- Oh, yes there was.

01:14:23.740 --> 01:14:25.630
I heard you both in that room.

01:14:25.630 --> 01:14:28.540
- Pardon me, Mrs. Topper, but it's getting kinda late.

01:14:28.540 --> 01:14:30.000
Can we settle this at home?

01:14:31.080 --> 01:14:31.890
- Yes, sir.

01:14:31.890 --> 01:14:34.610
- Cosmo, I should think after 20 years of married life,

01:14:34.610 --> 01:14:36.190
you wouldn't try to deceive me.

01:14:36.190 --> 01:14:38.910
Why, I remember our honeymoon in Atlantic City.

01:14:38.910 --> 01:14:41.070
You promised me you'd never look at another woman.

01:14:41.070 --> 01:14:41.890
- Mister--

01:14:44.680 --> 01:14:54.610
- You better keep away from me or you'll be a pope.

01:16:45.900 --> 01:16:48.280
- Clara, please, I've had a frightful night.

01:16:48.280 --> 01:16:51.060
- Boss, wait, don't sit in that chair.

01:16:51.060 --> 01:16:53.310
Whatever you do, don't sit in that chair.

01:16:53.310 --> 01:16:55.850
