Mr. Tomper!

01:17:36.500 --> 01:17:38.500
As I was saying, I'll always stand by you

01:17:38.500 --> 01:17:40.500
no matter what happens.

01:17:40.500 --> 01:17:42.680
Fair dear, just be quiet, will you please?

01:17:42.680 --> 01:17:44.530
Well, if that's the way you feel about it, I won't say another word.

01:18:05.210 --> 01:18:08.610
My dear, we should have one of these in our house for weekend guests.

01:18:08.610 --> 01:18:10.340
Surely!

01:18:11.390 --> 01:18:22.110
Clara, for heaven's sake, get out of there!

01:18:24.150 --> 01:18:26.410
Okay, you take it down this way and you go upstairs.

01:18:26.490 --> 01:18:28.100
If you'll find anything, I'll be right here.

01:18:28.520 --> 01:18:30.000
Boy, what a night!

01:18:30.700 --> 01:18:32.700
I've never been on such a merry-go-round in my life!

01:18:32.700 --> 01:18:41.140
I sure needed that one. Toppy, I just saw the murderer in the cellar.

01:18:41.140 --> 01:18:43.040
- Who is he? - I don't know. I couldn't see his face.

01:18:43.040 --> 01:18:45.040
But he was all muffled up in a big black cloak.

01:18:45.040 --> 01:18:48.540
Well, whoever he is, he was in that room when the housekeeper disappeared.

01:18:48.540 --> 01:18:51.990
Because I found a contraption in the fireplace that operates the chair she was sitting on.

01:18:51.990 --> 01:18:55.250
- What? - We've got to make him convict himself.

01:18:55.250 --> 01:19:00.000
- How? - You sit in that chair and tell them that you know who the murderer is.

01:19:00.320 --> 01:19:02.750
Me? Sitting in that chair?

01:19:02.750 --> 01:19:03.970
Well, I'll disappear, too.

01:19:03.970 --> 01:19:06.070
Oh, no, not if you keep your eye on the fireplace.

01:19:06.070 --> 01:19:08.230
And the first one that makes a move toward it,

01:19:08.230 --> 01:19:10.010
that's the one we're after.

01:19:10.010 --> 01:19:12.380
Oh.

01:19:12.380 --> 01:19:15.300
You're not afraid.

01:19:15.300 --> 01:19:17.720
