01:19:38.680 --> 01:19:45.330
The murderer didn't know he'd kill the wrong girl.

01:19:45.530 --> 01:19:47.570
When he found out, he was panicky and hid the body.

01:19:48.420 --> 01:19:50.780
You see, Doctor, I did not have hallucinations.

01:19:51.620 --> 01:19:52.840
Very interesting.

01:19:54.920 --> 01:19:56.500
