01:20:01.370 --> 01:20:07.260
The housekeeper knew, she knew too much, that she wasn't the one.

01:20:07.260 --> 01:20:13.940
When she was about to confess, she disappeared from this very chair.

01:20:13.940 --> 01:20:20.000
