01:20:20.000 --> 01:20:21.680
What do you say, Doc?

01:20:21.680 --> 01:20:23.850
He's looking right straight at you.

01:20:23.850 --> 01:20:27.870
The man's mad. I was nowhere near the fireplace when it happened.

01:20:27.870 --> 01:20:28.870
I was over there.

01:20:30.990 --> 01:20:34.510
Rama, you were standing here by the fireplace.

01:20:34.510 --> 01:20:38.130
You're mistaken, Dr. Jeris. I was standing by the library door.

01:20:38.130 --> 01:20:39.760
Now, wait a minute.

01:20:39.760 --> 01:20:43.630
Who was standing by the fireplace when the housekeeper disappeared?

01:20:43.630 --> 01:20:46.740
Why, father, you were there.

01:20:46.740 --> 01:20:51.650
Why, yes. Come to think of it, I was.

01:20:51.650 --> 01:20:56.390
Mr. Carrington, would you mind sitting in that chair?

01:20:56.390 --> 01:20:58.070
Of course not.

01:21:19.770 --> 01:21:20.320
I'll kill you!

01:21:30.030 --> 01:21:33.420
Never mind that. Put your hands up, too.

01:21:33.420 --> 01:21:36.490
And if you've got any sense, you won't move a muscle.

01:21:36.490 --> 01:21:39.210
You see? I told you it was him.

01:21:39.210 --> 01:21:45.330
Sergeant Roberts, it's been a pleasure to do business with a man of your intelligence.

