i'm walter harberg carrington's partner carrington was killed in a mine cave-in

01:25:25.610 --> 01:25:29.600
so that's it why are you ghost of a double-crossing crook

01:25:30.000 --> 01:25:31.560
- Anne must know about this.

01:25:31.560 --> 01:25:32.400
- Too late now.

01:25:32.400 --> 01:25:34.620
- Oh no, we're stuck here 'til she finds out.

01:25:34.620 --> 01:25:37.640
And when she knows the truth, I can go to heaven,

01:25:37.640 --> 01:25:39.900
and you can go to, give me a pencil quick,

01:25:39.900 --> 01:25:40.740
and a piece of paper.

01:25:40.740 --> 01:25:44.210
- Oh, wait a minute, wait a minute.

01:25:44.210 --> 01:25:46.260
- Take a letter.

01:25:46.260 --> 01:25:49.330
Dear Anne, I am not your father, period.

01:26:04.090 --> 01:26:06.940
Well, if he was looking for an accident, he sure found it.

01:26:06.940 --> 01:26:09.830
This is gonna cost him his driver's license, you know that, don't you?

01:26:09.830 --> 01:26:15.430
Here, Toppy, give this to Anne.

01:26:15.430 --> 01:26:22.570
I'm sorry about your father, Miss Carrington.

01:26:22.570 --> 01:26:24.070
Wait a minute, he wasn't her father.

01:26:24.070 --> 01:26:25.350
Miss Carrington, this is for you.

01:26:31.240 --> 01:26:32.400
