01:27:19.490 --> 01:27:20.190
No, ma'am.

01:27:20.190 --> 01:27:22.690
Oh, isn't it exciting?

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:33.590
Thanks, Eddie, you've been a great help.

01:27:33.790 --> 01:27:38.200
Sorry I had to dump you in the water, old boy.
